# text = Round the outer edge of the assemblage thus formed , flying detachments of plump white-headed children careered in perpetual motion ; while , mysteriously apart from the rest of the inhabitants , the musicians of the Baths stood collected in one lost corner , waiting the appearance of the first visitors to play the first tune of the season in the form of a serenade .
