# text = The light of a May evening was still bright on the tops of the great wooded hills watching high over the town on the right hand and the left ; and the cool breeze that comes before sunset came keenly fragrant here with the balsamic odor of the first of the Black Forest said the mayor's wife ( giving the landlord his title replied the landlord ( returning the compliment suggested the mayor's wife cried a child from the outskirts of the crowd .
