# text = He met Mr . Brock's distrust with the old uncomplaining resignation to it ; he maintained the same suspicious silence on the subject of his relatives and his early life ; he spoke of Allan's kindness to him with the same undisciplined fervor of gratitude and surprise he said to Mr . Brock , while Allan was asleep in the railway carriage said this strange man , with a momentary outburst of the hidden passion in him , and a sudden springing of angry tears in his wild brown eyes Once more Mr . Brock's humanity got the better of Mr . Brock's caution .
