# text = His retrospect over his own past life had amply satisfied him that his present sense of responsibility rested on no merely fanciful grounds , and , having brought him to that point , had left him there , standing at the window , and seeing nothing but the total darkness in his own mind faithfully reflected by the total darkness of the night thought the rector
