# text = After reading the narrative attentively to the last line ( under which appeared Allan's signature ), the doctor looked across the breakfast-table at Midwinter , and tapped his fingers on the manuscript with a satirical smile he said he added , looking at Allan , with a smile He turned again to Midwinter , with his anticipated triumph over a man whom he disliked a little too plainly visible in his face and manner he went on returned Midwinter , chafing under the doctor's looks and tones interposed Allan said Mr . Hawbury retorted Midwinter
