# text = He looked down the length of his own invaluable implement , with a grave interest and attention , seeing , apparently , not the long handle of a rake , but the long perspective of a vista , with a supplementary personal interest established at the end of it resumed this immovable man Having thus planted his offspring provisionally in his master's estimation , Abraham Sage shouldered his invaluable rake , and hobbled slowly out of view said Allan Allan saw his way to another compliment -- an elaborate compliment , in the shape of a trap , this time he said asked Miss Milroy , innocently .
