# text = Before he could answer , his daughter , who had been reading the advertisement , appealed to him eagerly , for the second time she said persisted the spoiled child said the major , turning to Allan , with a quaint and quiet humor Allan laughed , and Miss Milroy persisted she went on said the major good-humoredly he added , turning to his daughter Miss Milroy took up her father's pen , drew it through the last line of the advertisement , and wrote the altered address with her own hand as follows she said , bustling to her place at the breakfast-table she added , saucily Father , daughter , and guest sat down together sociably at the little round table , the best of good neighbors and good friends already .
