# text = Armadale's chance of regaling his friend and himself that day with the best wine in the cellar trembled in the balance , as the butler took his way back to the basement story said Midwinter , when they were alone Gently gently !' cried Allan , amazed at his friend's extraordinary earnestness Midwinter shook his head he said Allan withdrew to a side-table on which writing materials were placed he replied , and addressed himself forthwith to Mr . Darch , with his usual Spartan brevity of epistolary expression Having read this composition aloud with unconcealed admiration of his own rapidity of literary execution , Allan addressed the letter to Mr . Darch , and rang the bell continued Allan , joining his friend at the breakfast-table Breakfast over , the two friends went out to idle away the morning under the shade of a tree in the park .
