# text = Thrown off its balance by the events of the day , his mind was full of that sourly savage resistance to the inevitable self-assertion of wealth , so amiably deplored by the prosperous and the rich ; so bitterly familiar to the unfortunate and the poor he thought , looking contemptuously at the masses of rare and beautiful flowers that surrounded him He followed the artfully contrived ovals and squares of the Italian garden with a vagabond indifference to the symmetry of their construction and the ingenuity of their design he said , looking back with scornful eyes at the last path as he left it He entered the shrubbery which Allan had entered before him ; crossed the paddock and the rustic bridge beyond ; and reached the major's cottage .
