# text = For the first time in his life , Midwinter saw his own shy uneasiness in the presence of strangers reflected , with tenfold intensity of nervous suffering , in the face of another man -- and that man old enough to be his father He spoke with a timid gentleness of tone , an ingratiatory smile , and an anxious courtesy of manner , all distressingly suggestive of his being accustomed to receive rough answers in exchange for his own politeness from the persons whom he habitually addressed said Midwinter
