# text = He paused , to control his own mounting enthusiasm ; the clock at Strasbourg was to Major Milroy what the name of Michael Angelo was to Sir Joshua Reynolds pursued the major , smiling at Allan , and passing over another attempt of Midwinter's to seize on the talk , as if no such attempt had been made He opened the door , and apologized to Midwinter , with marked ceremony , for preceding him out of the room whispered Allan , as he and Miss Milroy followed she whispered back He's the best and dearest fellow in the world , " rejoined the outspoken Allan Miss Milroy made a little grimace , implying supreme indifference to Midwinter , and saucy surprise at Allan's earnest advocacy of the merits of his friend she wondered , privately
