# text = His eyes looked away from Allan for the first time persisted Allan Midwinter suddenly looked up again , his cheeks turning ashy pale , and his glittering black eyes fixed full on Allan's face he said returned Allan Midwinter's eyes dropped again to the crumbs on his plate he interposed , quickly asked Allan , a little uneasily Midwinter held out his hand he said He took Allan's hand , and wrung it hard he asked , growing paler and paler as he spoke exclaimed Allan Midwinter smiled faintly he said Allan hesitated he replied returned Allan His voice sank in spite of him , and he left the sentence unfinished Allan struck in , glibly
