# text = Far removed from all chance of seeing her , and from all chance of hearing of her -- alone with his own faithful recollection of what he owed to his friend -- he might hope to fight it down , as he had fought down the tears in his childhood under his gypsy master's stick ; as he had fought down the misery of his lonely youth time in the country bookseller's shop he said , as he turned wearily from the window With that resolution he left the room ; and , in leaving it , took the irrevocable step from Present to Future .
