# text = The servant waited inexorably for his orders said Pedgift Senior cried old Pedgift , rubbing his hands cheerfully when the servant had left the room Allan came back from the window he said said Pedgift Senior , still persisting , as only lawyers and women _can_ persist , in forcing his way little by little nearer and nearer to his own object said Allan asked the lawyer retorted Allan , hotly cried Pedgift Senior , warmly pursued the lawyer , dropping Allan's hand , and lapsing back instantly from sentiment to business said Allan , resolutely persisted Pedgift Allan opened his lips to protest , and checked himself , in despair of producing the slightest effect .
