# text = Pedgift Senior opened the door , stopped , considered , closed the door again , came back mysteriously with his pinch of snuff in suspense between his box and his nose , and repeating his invariable formula quietly resumed possession of his empty chair Allan , wondering , took the seat , in his turn , which he had just left .
