# text = She made another entry under the head of " Good resumed Neelie , looking over the reader's shoulder Allan went on Neelie immediately made a third entry on the side of " Good Allan skipped A fourth entry followed instantly on the cheering side of the pocket-book asked Neelie , tapping her chin impatiently with the end of the pencil rejoined Allan said Neelie She read for a minute in silence , over Allan's shoulder , and suddenly clasped her hands in despair she exclaimed asked Allan remonstrated Neelie she said pointing to the place Allan cleared his throat , and Neelie held the point of her pencil ready on the depressing side of the account -- otherwise the " Bad " page of the pocket-book Allan began Neelie made her first entry on the side of I'm only seventeen next birthday , and circumstances forbid me to confide my attachment to papa Neelie made another entry on the depressing side : " Allan is not a widower , and I am not a widow ; consequently , we are neither of us emancipated which papa would be certain to do said Allan said Neelie rejoined Allan He went on reading
