# text = All Neelie's meditated objections dwindled , in spite of her , to one feeble little question she whispered , toying nervously with the stud in the bosom of his shirt said Allan pleaded Neelie , clinging a little closer to him Allan promised to write twice a day , if she liked -- letter - writing , which was such an effort to other men , was no effort to _him_ proceeded Neelie Allan promised for the second time , on his sacred word of honor , and at the full compass of his voice .
