# text = Pausing , sometimes to think a little , sometimes to make another blot , she completed the letter in these words said Miss Gwilt , as she folded the letter up She wrote the necessary address to Major Milroy ; looked admiringly for the last time at the coarse and clumsy writing which her own delicate hand had produced ; and rose to post the letter herself , before she entered next on the serious business of packing up she thought , when the letter had been posted , and she was back again making her traveling preparations in her own room
