# text = He was clumsy , he was frowsy , he had a gaping mouth and a turn-up nose ; but the ineradicable female delight in being charming accepted him , for all that , in the character of a last chance she said , kindly , at the carriage door She gave him a friendly little pat on the cheek with two of her gloved fingers , and smiled , and nodded , and got into the fly she said to herself as the carriage drove off .
