# text = The sad story which he had related to Midwinter , of his drunken wife who had ended her miserable life in a lunatic asylum , was a story which he had shrunk from confiding to the talkative woman , who would have confided it in her turn to every one else in the house pursued the landlady , intent on the kettle said Mr . Bashwood , patiently repeated the sympathizing landlady For a moment , Mr . Bashwood looked at the woman with vacant eyes , and without attempting to answer her .
