# text = Bashwood the younger burst out laughing interposed Mr . Bashwood , suddenly interrupting his son His voice failed him , and he stopped without bringing the question to an end suggested Bashwood the younger , with another laugh answered Mr . Bashwood , striking his hand excitedly on the table , as his son paused and looked at him remarked Bashwood the younger , dryly Suddenly rising from his chair , Mr . Bashwood stretched across the table , and tried to take the papers from his son he burst out , eagerly rejoined his son exclaimed Mr . Bashwood Bashwood the younger , without noticing the interruption , folded up the Instructions for the Defense , which had now served their purpose , put them back in his bag , and produced a printed pamphlet in their place he said asked Mr . Bashwood , breathlessly rejoined Bashwood the younger cried his father retorted Bashwood the younger exclaimed Mr . Bashwood remarked Bashwood the younger interposed his father
