# text = The last effort of the son's sarcasm passed unheeded by the father he said to himself said Bashwood the younger , rising and stretching himself Mr . Bashwood rose to his feet , and looked his son steadily in the face he said Bashwood the younger started back a step he asked , in the blankest astonishment answered Mr . Bashwood The Spy of the Private Inquiry Office dropped back into his chair , cowed by his father's words and his father's looks he said to himself Mr . Bashwood looked at his watch , and hurriedly took his hat from a side-table he said asked Bashwood the younger , getting between his father and the door said the old man , trying to pass him He paused after making that reply .
