# text = By a coincidence so extraordinary that his enemies might have suspected it of not being a coincidence at all , the morning on which Miss Gwilt lost her patience proved to be also the morning on which the doctor lost his confidence for the first time he said , sitting down with a heavy sigh Miss Gwilt looked up at him irritably from her work she said answered the doctor , solemnly Miss Gwilt impatiently threw down her work she said reiterated the doctor , without taking the slightest notice of the interruption remarked the doctor , raising his eyes for the first time , and fixing them in steady inquiry on Miss Gwilt repeated the doctor , getting sternly on his feet , and taking up his hat as if he meant to leave the room asked Miss Gwilt rejoined the doctor He stood , hat in hand , waiting .
