# text = He was plainly gratified by the little attention which had included him in the conversation he said , addressing Miss Gwilt , with his best bow added the Dispenser , silently appealing to his employer to let him exhibit a little chemical knowledge on his own account rejoined the doctor he added , turning to Miss Gwilt continued the doctor , in the tone of a parent humoring a spoiled child The Resident Dispenser left the room .
