# text = As soon as his back was turned , the doctor began opening and shutting drawers in various parts of the Dispensary , with the air of a man who wants something in a hurry , and does not know where to find it he exclaimed , suddenly stopping at the drawer from which he had taken his cards of invitation on the previous day said the doctor , turning round briskly to Miss Gwilt He bustled away to the other end of the room -- without closing the drawer , and without taking away the duplicate key .
